0	section	Talking to Kangai Mau
1	line	Kangai Mau	Hello. I Kangai Mau of the Rantuki tribe.
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	And what are you doing in Brimhaven?
2	line	Player	And what are you doing in Brimhaven?
2	line	Kangai Mau	I looking for someone brave to go on important mission for me. Someone skilled in thievery and sneaking about. I am told I can find such people in Brimhaven.
2	line	Player	Tell me of this mission.
2	line	Kangai Mau	I need someone to go on a mission to the city of Ardougne. There you will find the house of Lord Handelmort. In his house he has our tribal totem.
2	line	Kangai Mau	We need it back.
2	line	Player	Why does he have it?
2	line	Kangai Mau	Lord Handelmort is an Ardougnese explorer which means he think he have the right to come to my tribal home, steal our stuff and put in his private museum.
2	select	Start The Tribal Totem quest?
2	option	Yes.
3	line	Player	Ok, I will get it back.
3	line	Kangai Mau	Best of luck with that adventurer.
3	line	Player	How can I find Handelmort's house? Ardougne is a big place...
3	line	Kangai Mau	I don't know Ardougne. You tell me.
3	action	end
2	option	No.
3	line	Player	Well good luck with that.
3	line	Kangai Mau	Let's hope I find some help soon.
3	action	end
1	option	I'm in search of adventure!
2	line	Player	I'm in search of adventure!
2	line	Kangai Mau	Adventure is something I may be able to give.
2	line	Kangai Mau	I need someone to go on a mission to the city of Ardougne. There you will find the house of Lord Handelmort. In his house he has our tribal totem.
2	action	above
1	option	Who are the Rantuki tribe?
2	line	Player	Who are the Rantuki tribe?
2	line	Kangai Mau	A proud and noble tribe of Karamja. But now we are few, as men come from across sea, steal our land, and settle on our hunting grounds.
2	line	Player	And what are you doing in Brimhaven?
2	action	above
