0	section	Talking to Wizard Cromperty
1	line	Wizard Cromperty	Hello there. My name is Cromperty. I am a Wizard, and an inventor.
1	line	Wizard Cromperty	You must be {player}. My good friend Sedridor has told me about you. As both wizard and inventor, he has aided me in my great invention!
1	select	Select an Option
1	option	Two jobs? That's got to be tough.
1	option	So what have you invented?
2	line	Player	So what have you invented?
2	line	Wizard Cromperty	Ah! My latest invention is my patent pending teleportation block! It emits a low level magical signal, that will allow me to locate it anywhere in the world, and teleport anything
2	line	Wizard Cromperty	directly to it! I hope to revolutionise the entire teleportation system! Don't you think I'm great? Uh, I mean it's great?
2	select	Select an Option
2	option	So where is the other block?
3	line	Player	So where is the other block?
3	line	Wizard Cromperty	Well... Hmm. I would guess somewhere between here and the Wizards' Tower in Misthalin. All I know is that it hasn't got there yet as the wizards there would have contacted me.
3	line	Wizard Cromperty	I'm using the GPDT for delivery. They assured me it would be delivered promptly.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	Can I be teleported please?
4	action	below
3	option	Who are the GPDT?
4	line	Player	Who are the GPDT?
4	line	Wizard Cromperty	The Gielinor Parcel Delivery Team. They come very highly recommended. Their motto is: 'We aim to deliver your stuff at some point after you have paid us!'
4	action	end
2	option	Can I be teleported please?
3	line	Player	Can I be teleported please?
3	line	Wizard Cromperty	By all means! I'm afraid I can't give you any specifics as to where you will come out however. Presumably wherever the other block is located.
3	select	Select an Option
3	option	Yes, that sounds good. Teleport me!
4	line	Player	Yes, that sounds good. Teleport me!
4	line	Wizard Cromperty	Okey dokey! Ready?
4	line	Wizard Cromperty	Dipsolum sententa sententi!
4	action	GDPT Depot]].)
